    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeless Odyssey </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/81df08f9dc612c94603dfd47c1ad6142.poster.avif?t=1744724208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/81df08f9dc612c94603dfd47c1ad6142.webm?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/81df08f9dc612c94603dfd47c1ad6142.mp4?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a universe where the past, present, and future are yours to command! In <strong>Timeless Odyssey</strong>, you\u2019re not just playing through time\u2014you\u2019re rewriting it. Every decision you make sends ripples through history, altering the very fate of the world. Danger lurks in every era, and only you can stop the monstrous creatures that threaten humanity\u2019s future. The clock is ticking, and the stakes have never been higher. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Travel through iconic time periods, track down dangerous anomalies, and neutralize them before they can alter history. But tread carefully\u2014every move you make could create an unforeseen ripple that might shape the future in ways you never imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Travel Like Never Before:</strong> From the prehistoric wilds to futuristic metropolises, explore vividly realized worlds filled with secrets, challenges, and unforgettable moments. Each era offers a completely unique experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/6d3ba6465e2d2f45ebc314681cfd93bc.poster.avif?t=1744724208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/6d3ba6465e2d2f45ebc314681cfd93bc.webm?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/6d3ba6465e2d2f45ebc314681cfd93bc.mp4?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat &amp; Strategy:</strong> Arm yourself with weapons across centuries, from primitive tools to cutting-edge technology, and master the art of tactical combat. Think carefully, as every battle requires more than just strength\u2014it\u2019s about wits, strategy, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/55aa3c8a58b9b394843828b4a652e013.poster.avif?t=1744724208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/55aa3c8a58b9b394843828b4a652e013.webm?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/55aa3c8a58b9b394843828b4a652e013.mp4?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Butterfly Effect:</strong> Change one small thing in the past, and watch how it reshapes the future in ways you can\u2019t predict. Every choice you make, every creature you eliminate, could lead to wildly different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World You Can Interact With:</strong> Time is more than just a backdrop\u2014it's a living, breathing puzzle. Engage with characters, solve environmental puzzles, and gather intel to give yourself the upper hand in missions that span the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Endless Mystery:</strong> Uncover the truth behind the dangerous creatures that plague history and what mysterious force is pulling the strings. As you peel back layers, you\u2019ll realize the true cost of tampering with time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Unique Abilities:</strong> Evolve as you progress! Upgrade your character with new skills and abilities, tailor your playstyle to become the ultimate time-hunting expert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world is in your hands, and time is ticking. Will you be able to stop the catastrophic forces at play, or will your actions lead to a timeline you can\u2019t undo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeless Odyssey</strong> isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it's a chance to rewrite history. Will you be the hero who saves the future, or the one who causes its demise?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeless Odyssey </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/81df08f9dc612c94603dfd47c1ad6142.poster.avif?t=1744724208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/81df08f9dc612c94603dfd47c1ad6142.webm?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454280/extras/81df08f9dc612c94603dfd47c1ad6142.mp4?t=1744724208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a universe where the past, present, and future are yours to command! In <strong>Timeless Odyssey</strong>, you\u2019re not just playing through time\u2014you\u2019re rewriting it. Every decision you make sends ripples through history, altering the very fate of the world. Danger lurks in every era, and only you can stop the monstrous creatures that threaten humanity\u2019s future. The clock is ticking, and the stakes have never been higher. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Travel through iconic time periods, track down dangerous anomalies, and neutralize them before they can alter history. But tread carefully\u2014every move you make could create an unforeseen ripple that might shape the future in ways you never imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Travel Like Never Before:</strong> From the prehistoric wilds to futuristic metropolises, explore vividly realized worlds filled with secrets, challenges, and unforgettable moments. Each era offers a completely unique experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati